From: kadie@cs.uiuc.edu (Carl M Kadie)
Subject:  Chronicle Article on U. of Texas at Dallas Lawsuit
Message-ID: <CI3ECK.1o1@cs.uiuc.edu>
Date: Wed, 15 Dec 1993 20:02:43 GMT
    Posted on alt.comp.acad-freedom.news with permission from
